{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，Y 的 S09 把“想在难受时有人陪”强化成“怕孤单到连受过的气也肯再受”，对人物动机作了更重的推断，削弱了一点原有的含蓄和准确性。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"作为边听边扫的普通观众，Y 用关键词加亮把每段真正重要的心理转折凸显出来，感受又按音乐进程出现，不必同时面对一大堆静态描述，尤其 S03、S06、S13 的改善明显。X 的完整叙述更自然，人物行为背后的因果关系交代得稍好；但 Y 对前后情绪的递进、旧记忆与舞步和旋律的反复呼应，以及身体反应、心理变化的细节呈现更有层次，整体更容易让人既跟上故事，又听见音乐里的变化。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "ca2db2f4-f472-4880-a228-28a490fab197", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261107T194210158144Z", "elapsed_seconds": 57.562, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T19:43:07.735812+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "a9f59398b20d94e5be8f88b828febdbc22e0e2a5106e8f3daa45e7386aa12879", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools